, se maximiza 
\begin_inset Formula $\gamma\ln\big[w\,L-v(L)-U_S^0\big]+(1-\gamma)\ln\big[p\,F(L)-w\,L-B^0\big]$
\end_inset

. Llamamos 
\begin_inset Formula $S\equiv p\,F(L)-v(L)-U_S^0-B^0$
\end_inset

