\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
CondiciÃ³n de primer orden respecto a 
\begin_inset Formula $w$
\end_inset

: 
\begin_inset Formula $\dfrac{\gamma\,L}{U_S-U_S^0}=\dfrac{(1-\gamma)\,L}{B-B^0}$
\end_inset

; como 
\begin_inset Formula $(U_S-U_S^0)+(B-B^0)=S$
